<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-CBA cuts variable mortgage rate.</title>
<headline>RTRS-CBA cuts variable mortgage rate.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commonwealth Bank of Australia (CBA) said on Wednesday it lowered its standard variable mortgage rate to 7.55 percent from 8.25 percent.</p>
<p>The bank, one of Australia's big four, also said it cut its &quot;no-frills&quot; mortgage rate to 6.95 percent from 7.35 percent.  </p>
<p>The bank said the new rates are effective from February 13 for new applicants and from March 27 for existing borrowers.</p>
</text>
